--- 
Title: Texas Roadhouse Rolls
Tags: Bakery
---

In #mixing bowl{} mix together 100F @Milk{1 cup}, @Sugar{1/3 cup}, & @Yeast{1 packet or 2 1/4 tsp}. Let sit for 5 minutes until foamy.

Add @Eggs{1}, melted @Butter{1/3 cup}, @Salt{1 tsp}, & @Flour{3.5 cups}. Mix until dough is smooth.

Let rise for 1 hour in a warm place until doubled in size.

Then roll out to half inch thick, cut into 16 pieces, and shape into rolls. Place on a greased #baking sheet{} and brush tops with butter. 

Let rise for another 30 minutes. 

Bake at 350F for 10-20 minutes until golden brown.